      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알로라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CB85CB77C0021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 알로라 라이츄 보급 위원회의\n위원장이랍니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE040020BCF4AE090020C704C6D0D68CC758000AC704C6D0C7A5C774B78DB2C8B2E40021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...위원회라고는 해도\n멤버는 저 혼자지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC704C6D0D68CB77CACE0B2940020D574B3C4000ABA64BC84B2940020C8000020D63CC790C9C0B9CCC694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리전폼에 대해서는 잘 알고 계신가요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n모르셔도 일단 마저 설명할게요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACC804D3FCC5D00020B300D574C11CB2940020C7980020C54CACE00020ACC4C2E0AC00C694003F00100001BE01000ABAA8B974C154B3C40020C77CB2E80020B9C8C8000020C124BA85D560AC8CC694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 중에는 사는 지방의 영향을 받아\n다른 모습이 되는 경우가 있죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C911C5D0B2940020C0ACB2940020C9C0BC29C7580020C601D5A5C7440020BC1BC544000AB2E4B9780020BAA8C2B5C7740020B418B2940020ACBDC6B0AC000020C788C8E0003F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모두에게 잘 알려진 라이츄도\n알로라지방에서는 다른 모습으로 진화해요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B450C5D0AC8C0020C7980020C54CB824C9C40020B77CC774CE04B3C4000AC54CB85CB77CC9C0BC29C5D0C11CB2940020B2E4B9780020BAA8C2B5C73CB85C0020C9C4D654D574C694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떻게 다른지는 설명하는 것보다\n라이츄끼리 비교하는 편이 좋을 것 같네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5BBAC8C0020B2E4B978C9C0B2940020C124BA85D558B2940020AC83BCF4B2E4000AB77CC774CE04B07CB9AC0020BE44AD50D558B2940020D3B8C7740020C88BC7440020AC830020AC19B124C694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 이렇게 하죠!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n당신의 라이츄와 제 알로라 라이츄로\n포켓몬 승부를 하는 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020C774B807AC8C0020D558C8E0002100100001BE01000AB2F9C2E0C7580020B77CC774CE04C6400020C81C0020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE04B85C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558B2940020AC70C608C6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 라이츄와 제 알로라 라이츄로\n포켓몬 승부를 할 준비가 되시면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020B77CC774CE04C6400020C81C0020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE04B85C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5600020C900BE44AC000020B418C2DCBA7400100001BE00000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신의 라이츄와 제 알로라 라이츄로\n포켓몬 승부를 해요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n둘 다 지닌 포켓몬에\n1마리만 넣어서 말이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7580020B77CC774CE04C6400020C81C0020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE04B85C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D574C694002E00100001BE01000AB4580020B2E40020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0000A0031B9C8B9ACB9CC0020B123C5B4C11C0020B9D0C774C5D0C6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 알로라 라이츄!\n기운이 넘쳐 보여서 좋지만 저와의 승부는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n일반적인 라이츄 1마리로 부탁드려요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE040021000AAE30C6B4C7740020B118CCD00020BCF4C5ECC11C0020C88BC9C0B9CC0020C800C640C7580020C2B9BD80B29400100001BE00000AC77CBC18C801C7780020B77CC774CE0400200031B9C8B9ACB85C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB824C694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오, 라이츄를 데려오셨군요!\n그럼 제 알로라 라이츄와<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬 승부를 해 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624002C0020B77CC774CE04B97C0020B370B824C624C168AD70C6940021000AADF8B7FC0020C81C0020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE04C64000100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5740020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "할래요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D560B798C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안 할래요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5480020D560B798C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알로라 라이츄 보급 위원회 활동을\n할 수 있게 좀 도와주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE040020BCF4AE090020C704C6D0D68C0020D65CB3D9C744000AD5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020C8800020B3C4C640C8FCC138C6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두 라이츄 모두 멋지지만\n알로라의 모습은 타입이 다르니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n너무 당황해하지 마세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4500020B77CC774CE040020BAA8B4500020BA4BC9C0C9C0B9CC000AC54CB85CB77CC7580020BAA8C2B5C7400020D0C0C785C7740020B2E4B974B2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AB108BB340020B2F9D669D574D558C9C00020B9C8C138C6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멋진 승리였어요...!\n하지만 알로라 라이츄 보급 위원회 활동은<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n지금부터가 진짜예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4BC9C40020C2B9B9ACC600C5B4C694002E002E002E0021000AD558C9C0B9CC0020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE040020BCF4AE090020C704C6D0D68C0020D65CB3D9C74000100001BE00000AC9C0AE08BD80D130AC000020C9C4C9DCC608C694002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 알로라 라이츄와\n당신의 라이츄를 교환하지 않으시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020C54CB85CB77C0020B77CC774CE04C640000AB2F9C2E0C7580020B77CC774CE04B97C0020AD50D658D558C9C00020C54AC73CC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "교환해요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD50D658D574C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 항상 기다리고 있을 테니\n마음이 바뀌시면 언제든지 말씀해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020D56DC0C10020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C7440020D14CB2C8000AB9C8C74CC7740020BC14B00CC2DCBA740020C5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020B9D0C500D5740020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "라이츄와 라이츄를 교환하며\n알로라의 모습을 세상에 널리 알립시다~♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B77CC774CE04C6400020B77CC774CE04B97C0020AD50D658D558BA70000AC54CB85CB77CC7580020BAA8C2B5C7440020C138C0C1C5D00020B110B9AC0020C54CB9BDC2DCB2E4007E266A001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 마음 저도 잘 알아요!\n포켓몬 교환은 가슴 아픈 일이기도 하니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020B9C8C74C0020C800B3C40020C7980020C54CC544C6940021000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020AD50D658C7400020AC00C2B40020C544D5080020C77CC774AE30B3C40020D558B2C8AE4CC6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알로라의 모습도 좋지만\n일반적인 라이츄도 정말 매력적이라니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CB85CB77CC7580020BAA8C2B5B3C40020C88BC9C0B9CC000AC77CBC18C801C7780020B77CC774CE04B3C40020C815B9D00020B9E4B825C801C774B77CB2C8AE4CC6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "라라라~이!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B77CB77CB77C007EC77400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 저는 다시 여행을 떠나야겠어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n알로라지방에서\n수많은 알로라 라이츄와 친구가 되고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그들을 세상에 전파하는 것이야말로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n보급 위원회의 사명이니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
